---
import GameLayout from '../../layouts/GameLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/components/chicken-neon.css';
---
<GameLayout title="Chicken Run — Neon Wilds" description="An endless one-button neon survival runner. Collect corn, dodge predators and outlast the collapsing grid.">
  <section class="neon-chicken" id="neon-chicken" aria-label="Chicken Run Neon Wilds">
    <header class="neon-header">
      <a class="neon-back" href="/games/">← GAMES</a>
      <div class="neon-brand"><span class="neon-brand-mark">◈</span><strong>CHICKEN RUN</strong><small>NEON WILDS</small></div>
      <button id="neon-sound" type="button" aria-pressed="false">SOUND OFF</button>
    </header>
    <div id="neon-menu" class="neon-menu">
      <div class="neon-intro">
        <p class="neon-eyebrow">SURVIVAL PROTOCOL / 01</p>
        <h1>RUN <em>FOREVER.</em></h1>
        <p>Five armored chickens. One jump button. An unstable world.<br />Collect corn to fuel your suit. Never let the predators catch you.</p>
      </div>
      <h2 class="neon-section-title">CHOOSE YOUR CHICKEN <span>5 PILOTS / UNIQUE ABILITIES</span></h2>
      <div class="neon-roster" role="group" aria-label="Choose a chicken">
        <button type="button" class="neon-pilot" data-bird="0" aria-pressed="false">
          <canvas class="neon-avatar" data-bird-preview="0" width="100" height="90" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><strong>SUNRISE</strong><small>SPEED DEMON</small><span>FASTEST RUN · LOW JUMP</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="neon-pilot" data-bird="1" aria-pressed="false">
          <canvas class="neon-avatar" data-bird-preview="1" width="100" height="90" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><strong>PEPPER</strong><small>ALL-ROUNDER</small><span>BALANCED ABILITIES</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="neon-pilot" data-bird="2" aria-pressed="true">
          <canvas class="neon-avatar" data-bird-preview="2" width="100" height="90" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><strong>PEARL</strong><small>HIGH JUMPER</small><span>HIGHEST JUMP · SLOWEST</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="neon-pilot" data-bird="3" aria-pressed="false">
          <canvas class="neon-avatar" data-bird-preview="3" width="100" height="90" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><strong>MANGO</strong><small>SURVIVOR</small><span>BEST FUEL ECONOMY</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="neon-pilot" data-bird="4" aria-pressed="false">
          <canvas class="neon-avatar" data-bird-preview="4" width="100" height="90" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><strong>INDIGO</strong><small>JET ACE</small><span>LONGEST JET BOOST</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="neon-launch">
        <div class="neon-readout"><span>SELECTED</span><strong id="neon-selected">PEARL · HIGH JUMPER</strong><span>PERSONAL BEST</span><strong id="neon-best">00:00</strong></div>
        <button id="neon-start" type="button" class="neon-primary">▶ START RUN</button>
      </div>
      <div class="neon-explainer">
        <p><strong>ONE BUTTON.</strong> Tap to jump. Tap again midair for a corn-powered jetpack boost. Running is automatic.</p>
        <p><strong>THREE PREDATORS.</strong> Foxes pursue, coyotes ambush, and eagles strike from above. Obstacles and void gaps are lethal.</p>
        <p><strong>GRID INSTABILITY.</strong> After three minutes, EMP storms, falling plasma, broken tracks, and gravity surges begin. Disasters become more frequent the longer you survive.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="neon-classic-note">Want to play the previous online race? <a href="/games/chicken-classic/">OPEN CLASSIC MULTIPLAYER</a> <span>· Neon Wilds online survival is a separate upcoming migration.</span></p>
    </div>
    <section id="neon-run" class="neon-run" hidden aria-label="Neon Wilds endless runner">
      <div class="neon-hud">
        <div><small>SURVIVAL</small><strong id="neon-time">00:00</strong></div>
        <div><small>RUNNER</small><strong id="neon-chicken-name">PEARL</strong></div>
        <div><small>DISTANCE</small><strong id="neon-distance">0 m</strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="neon-bars">
        <div class="neon-meter"><div class="neon-meter-label"><span>CORN POWER</span><strong id="neon-fuel-value">82%</strong></div><div class="neon-meter-track"><div id="neon-fuel" class="neon-meter-fill"></div></div></div>
        <div class="neon-meter neon-fox-meter"><div class="neon-meter-label"><span>FOX PROXIMITY</span><span>DANGER</span></div><div class="neon-meter-track"><div id="neon-fox" class="neon-meter-fill"></div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="neon-stage">
        <canvas id="neon-canvas" width="1100" height="520" aria-label="Horizontal survival course with obstacles, corn, predators, and an armored running chicken. Tap to jump, tap again midair to fire the jetpack." tabindex="0"></canvas>
        <div id="neon-end" class="neon-end" hidden role="status" aria-live="polite">
          <span>SIGNAL LOST / RUN ENDED</span><strong id="neon-final">00:00</strong><p id="neon-death">CAUGHT</p>
          <p id="neon-new-best" hidden>NEW PERSONAL BEST</p>
          <button id="neon-retry" type="button" class="neon-primary">↻ TRY AGAIN</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p id="neon-status" class="neon-status" role="status" aria-live="off">AUTO-RUN · TAP JUMP / TAP AGAIN TO BOOST</p>
      <div class="neon-game-controls">
        <div class="neon-control-links"><button id="neon-pause" type="button">PAUSE</button><button id="neon-menu-button" type="button">CHANGE CHICKEN</button></div>
        <button id="neon-jump" class="neon-jump" type="button" aria-label="Jump, then activate jetpack in midair">↑ <span>JUMP</span></button>
      </div>
      <p class="neon-key-hint">SPACE / ↑ / W = JUMP · P = PAUSE · NO SPRINT · NO FORCED ROTATION</p>
    </section>
    <p id="neon-boot" class="neon-boot" role="status">INITIALIZING NEON WILDS…</p>
  </section>
</GameLayout>
<script is:inline type="module">
  import('/games/chicken-neon/app.mjs').catch(error=>{
    console.error('Neon Wilds failed to load',error);
    const note=document.getElementById('neon-boot');
    if(note)note.textContent=`GAME COULD NOT START: ${error.message}`;
  });
</script>
